    "privacyLastUpdated":  "Igihe gishya: Werurwe 2026",
    "privacyIntro":  "Rwanda Traffic Rule yitangiye kurinda ibanga ryawe. Aya mabwiriza asobanura uko dukusanya, dukoresha, kandi turinda amakuru yawe bwite. Turi serivisi y\u0027uburezi yigenga ntabwo dufitanye isano n\u0027ubutegetsi.",
    "privacyDataCollection":  "Gukusanya amakuru",
    "privacyDataCollectionBody":  "Dukusanya nimero ya telefoni n\u0027izina ryawe ryuzuye igihe wiyandikisha. Nanone dukusanya ibisubizo by\u0027imyitozo n\u0027amakuru y\u0027iterambere ryawe. ID y\u0027igikoresho yihariye ikorwa kugira ngo konti yawe ibe irinzwe.",
    "privacyDataUsage":  "Uko dukoresha amakuru yawe",
    "privacyDataUsageBody":  "Amakuru yawe akoreshwa mu gutanga no kunoza serivisi zacu, gukurikirana iterambere ryawe, gucunga abonement yawe, no kukugezaho amakuru y\u0027ingenzi.",
    "privacyDataProtection":  "Kurinda amakuru",
    "privacyDataProtectionBody":  "Dukoresha ingamba z\u0027umutekano z\u0027urwego rwo hejuru harimo kohereza amakuru mu bwiru no kubika mu buryo bwizewe. Amakuru yawe bwite ntabwo asangizwa  n\u0027abandi utabyemeje.",
    "privacyDataSharing":  "Gusangira amakuru",
