    "privacyUserRights":  "Uburenganzira bwawe",
    "privacyUserRightsBody":  "Ufite uburenganzira bwo kubona, guhindura, cyangwa gusiba amakuru yawe bwite igihe icyo ari cyo cyose binyuze mu guhitamo Siba Konti mu igenamiterere.",
    "termsLastUpdated":  "Igihe gishya: Werurwe 2026",
    "termsIntro":  "Mu gukoresha Rwanda Traffic Rule, wemeye amabwiriza akurikira. Rwanda Traffic Rule ni porogaramu y\u0027uburezi yigenga igufasha kwitegura ikizamini cy\u0027amategeko. Ntabwo dufitanye isano n\u0027ubutegetsi cyangwa ikigo cy\u0027ibizamini.",
    "termsAcceptance":  "Kwemera amabwiriza",
    "termsAcceptanceBody":  "Mu gufungura konti no gukoresha iyi porogaramu, wemeye gukurikiza aya mabwiriza. Niba udabyemeye, nyamuneka hagarika gukoresha iyi porogaramu.",
    "termsUserAccount":  "Konti y\u0027umukoresha",
    "termsUserAccountBody":  "Ni wowe ubifitiye inshingano zo kurinda umutekano wa konti yawe. Buri konti ihuza na nimero imwe ya telefoni n\u0027igikoresho kimwe. Gusangira amakuru ya konti ntibibujijwe.",
    "termsContent":  "Ibiri mu bizamini",
    "termsContentBody":  "Ibiri mu bizamini byose ni iby\u0027uburezi n\u0027imyitozo gusa. Ntabwo bigereranywa n\u0027ikizamini cy\u0027ukuri cy\u0027ubutegetsi. Ntidushobora kwemeza ibisubizo by\u0027ikizamini. Rwanda Traffic Rule ntabwo ifitanye isano n\u0027ubutegetsi.",
